# Aegaeon server unwrap_or_default inventory.
#
# This file is intentionally exact: each non-comment line must match one
# `rg -N "unwrap_or_default" crates/server/src` output line. New entries
# need review because silent defaulting can hide persistence, protocol, or
# security boundary bugs.

# Optional refresh and OIDC commit fields use empty payloads only when their
# corresponding has_refresh/has_oidc_session discriminator is false.
